From: local
Subject: [PATCH] centeredmaster adapted for dwm 6.8 + prior patches

Replace stock tile with centeredmaster (default) and
centeredfloatingmaster. Both honor functionalgaps/pertag.
Super+u selects centeredmaster, Super+o centeredfloatingmaster.

